        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Game Features Two Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mode 1: Idle Pet Mushroom (Desktop Mode)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An idle pet-raising experience — right on your desktop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every keyboard or mouse input generates nutrients, helping your mushroom grow faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try it now and see whose mushroom grows the longest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mode 2: RPG + Miner</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep underground lie mysterious &quot;minerals&quot; — the key to victory in battle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25 types of minerals</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomly spawn during gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control a hook to grab them</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your loot in the <strong>shop</strong> to boost your character’s power.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>38 different items</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random item spawns</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy with gold collected</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Content</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 enemy types with unique styles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies spawn randomly across stages</strong></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Game Features Two Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mode 1: Idle Pet Mushroom (Desktop Mode)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An idle pet-raising experience — right on your desktop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every keyboard or mouse input generates nutrients, helping your mushroom grow faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try it now and see whose mushroom grows the longest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mode 2: RPG + Miner</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep underground lie mysterious &quot;minerals&quot; — the key to victory in battle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25 types of minerals</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomly spawn during gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control a hook to grab them</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your loot in the <strong>shop</strong> to boost your character’s power.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>38 different items</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random item spawns</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy with gold collected</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Content</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 enemy types with unique styles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies spawn randomly across stages</strong></p></li></ul>",
